    m_HorizontalOverflow: 1
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'WELCOME

    N: fish and ship windows.

    NE: combat pen. E: hazard

    lane.
    SE: pickup shelf.

    S/E: doors. Centre:

    puzzles. SW: hatch and

    basement.
    W: movement

    course. Walk up to a sign

    to read it. Turn around to

    meet
    the QA lead.'
